'@@author Rixte
@startuml
!include ../shortfall/readable.iuml
title Cancelling a plan change
actor User
participant "mishMash:MishMash" as MishMash
participant "command:Command" as Command
note over MishMash, Command : Starts after a question was returned.
MishMash -> MishMash : userConfirms(question)
activate MishMash
MishMash -> User : display question (y/n)
User -> MishMash : other answer, blank line, or EOF
MishMash --> MishMash : false
deactivate MishMash
MishMash -> User : display "Cancelled. Nothing was changed."
note over MishMash, Command
  execute is not called.
  Plan, groceries, and settings stay unchanged.
end note
@enduml
'@@author
